stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Inspect
    Inspect --> Fresh: no schema and no history
    Inspect --> CurrentShared: recognized shared history
    Inspect --> KnownLegacy: recognized legacy or Auth alias
    Inspect --> CurrentModule: module histories current
    Inspect --> FailClosed: unknown, mixed, partial or fingerprint mismatch

    Fresh --> PlanMigrations
    CurrentShared --> CopyExactOwnership: preserve ProductVersion
    KnownLegacy --> VerifyFingerprint
    VerifyFingerprint --> NormalizeCanonical: complete match
    VerifyFingerprint --> FailClosed: incomplete match
    CopyExactOwnership --> ModuleHistories
    NormalizeCanonical --> ModuleHistories
    CurrentModule --> PlanMigrations
    ModuleHistories --> PlanMigrations
    PlanMigrations --> ApplyPending: approved apply mode
    PlanMigrations --> [*]: preflight or dry-run
    ApplyPending --> Validate
    Validate --> [*]: all required IDs present
    Validate --> FailClosed: ownership or pending mismatch
    FailClosed --> [*]: non-zero exit, no automatic repair
